      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan pulls up a sinking myriad eyes clear bull head from Falling Heavenly River. An immemorial desolate beast can rival rank eight Gu Immortals. The head alone is like a small hill, and most of its weight sits in the horns; even after a sword light cuts them down to half, they remain extremely heavy.",
